          <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fu-ink">Staff desk</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-[40ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-fu-muted">A live order inbox for the floor — new orders, prep queue, and daily totals, gated behind staff auth.</p>
          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fu-link transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-fu-ink">
